    "engineLifespan": "500,000+ km. The OM612 inline-5 block is legendary for its raw durability. While the auxiliary systems (injectors, intake manifold) require maintenance, the rotating assembly is practically immortal.",
    "turboType": "Single Variable Geometry Turbocharger (VNT). Controlled via vacuum to minimize turbo lag and optimize low-end diesel torque.",
    "ecuType": "Bosch EDC15C6. Highly tunable, extremely robust, and applies software torque limiters in low gears to protect the 5G-Tronic transmission and transfer case.",
