    "timingType": "Simplex timing chain driving dual overhead camshafts per bank with continuous variable valve timing (VVT). *CRITICAL NOTE:* Early M273 engines (2007-2008) suffer from a catastrophic metallurgical defect where the timing chain idler gear sprocket was manufactured from soft sintered metal, causing the teeth to wear down completely and throw off engine timing.",
