    "engineLifespan": "250,000 - 350,000+ km (provided the idler gear issue is resolved on 2007-2008 models). The aluminum block and 4-valve cylinder heads are robust, but auxiliary plastic components and timing gear wear heavily dictate its longevity.",
    "turboType": "Naturally Aspirated. Displaces massive volume (5.5L) to achieve V8 power without the complexity of turbos.",
