      "AIRMATIC Air Suspension Failure: The heavy 5.5L V8 puts immense strain on the air struts. Rubber bladders develop microscopic leaks, causing the vehicle to sag and burning out the compressor pump.",
      "Salt-Belt Subframe Corrosion: In Northern US states and Canada, the W164 front lower control arm mounts and subframe are prone to severe structural rust."
