    "engineLifespan": "400,000+ km. The core OM642 engine block is incredibly robust. However, its lifespan is heavily dictated by notorious external seal failures (oil cooler, turbo inlet) that must be addressed.",
    "turboType": "Single Variable Geometry Turbocharger (VNT) mounted electronically. Positioned centrally in the engine V.",
    "ecuType": "Bosch EDC16+. For the ML 280 CDI, Mercedes deliberately applied a software 'detune' to create a cheaper entry-level model. It is mechanically identical to the 224 hp ML 320 CDI.",
