      "blockDesign": "Longitudinal 3.0L 72-degree V6. Constructed with an aluminum block featuring cast iron cylinder liners. The unusual 72-degree V-angle creates a highly compact engine, but introduces inherent secondary vibrations, necessitating a dedicated, counter-rotating balance shaft housed deep within the block.",
