        "label": "AdBlue Tank & Heater Element",
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": -0.15,
        "z": -0.60,
        "critical": true,
        "details": "Located beneath the rear cargo floor. The internal heating element burns out, triggering the 'Starts Remaining' countdown that eventually immobilizes the vehicle."
