            automatics: [ { name: "9-Speed Automatic (9G-Tronic / 725.0)", torqueLimit: "700 Nm", oilType: "9.5L MB 236.17 (Blue ATF)", note: "The saving grace of the GLE 350. The 9 gears perfectly mask the narrow powerband of the 2.0L 4-cylinder engine, keeping it constantly in its 370 Nm torque peak. Demands strict 60,000 mile (100,000 km) services." } ] 
