            "Engine-Out Chain Replacement - Neglecting oil changes stretches the rear-mounted timing chain. Because it sits against the firewall, the transmission or engine must be dropped to service it.",
            "Carbon Chunk Ingestion - Thick carbon buildup on the direct-injected intake valves can break off, falling into the cylinders and deeply scoring the NANOSLIDE coating.",
            "Wet Start-Up Clutch Shudder - The ISG integrates directly with the AMG Speedshift TCT 9G. Skipping transmission fluid changes will cause the system to shudder violently during high-performance shifts."
