            "EGR & DPF Soot Clogging: Cold ICE engagements during hybrid driving cause incomplete combustion, rapidly coking the EGR valve and clogging the DPF.",
            "HV Battery Coolant Valve Leaks: Complex multi-circuit cooling valves for the high-voltage pack develop internal leaks or electrical faults."
