        timingType: "Chain (Located at the REAR of the block. The Maybach utilizes a detuned AMG M177 block, meaning it shares the exact same rear-mounted timing chain layout packaged against the firewall. Given that Maybachs are frequently subjected to extensive idling while waiting for VIP passengers, oil degrades rapidly. Strict 8,000 km synthetic oil intervals are absolute law to prevent tensioner failure and an engine-out service.)", 
