        engineLifespan: "200,000+ km (ICE) / 6-8 Years (48V System) (Mechanically, the AMG-derived M177 engine is a forged masterpiece built to withstand 700+ hp, meaning at 557 hp, the internal components are essentially asleep. However, the extreme sound deadening in the Maybach traps even MORE heat in the engine bay, rapidly baking the Hot-V coolant lines. The lifespan of the vehicle is entirely dictated by the 48V electrical architecture and the insanely complex E-Active Body Control suspension.)", 
