        ecuType: "Bosch MED 17.7.5 (Bespoke Maybach Calibration. The ECU and TCU feature unique software completely distinct from standard Mercedes or AMG models. The throttle map is intentionally dulled to prevent sudden jerks, and the 'Maybach Drive Program' forces the 9G-Tronic transmission to start in 2nd gear to ensure perfectly seamless, imperceptible take-offs.)", 
